{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12357","headline":"禁闱玩雪寄薛左丞 · 钱起","name":"禁闱玩雪寄薛左丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄云低禁苑，飞雪满神州。\n虚白生台榭，寒光入冕旒。\n粉凝宫壁静，乳结洞门幽。\n细绕回风转，轻随落羽浮。\n怒涛堆砌石，新月孕帘钩。\n爲报诗人道，丰年颂圣猷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}